      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "What happens to the upload after it is ingested — it is RETIRED, not left and not deleted",
      "prov:value": "**Owner's ruling, 2026-09-29**, in two parts. First, answering *\"why are\ningested things still sitting in uploads and not moived to library of\nappropraite harness?\"*:\n\n> **no, uploads is archival copy.**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-29"
