      "cat-harness:section": "Swept 2026-09-30 — and the sweep is now `check:uploads-retired`, not a habit",
      "prov:value": "**The hand sweep that first implemented this rule got four things wrong, in\none commit, and each was invisible from its own output.**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion/uploads-retirement.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Swept 2026-09-30 — and the sweep is now `check:uploads-retired`, not a habit",
      "prov:value": "It refuses rather than passing when no library records a `source_sha256` — the\nfirst version of it resolved libraries from the repository root, got **zero**,\nand printed a green line over 15 files."
